what is up everybody it's annamac here  for  anime outpour and the moment we've all  been waiting for  for a very long time is finally here  the dark secrets of the mysterious one  for all quirk have just been revealed to  deku and we  finally know why all might deliberately  chose to hide information about the  fourth  one for all user from deku as it turns  out  one for all has serious consequences for  its users  and deku might end up being the very  last  user of one for all this was a crazy  chapter  so much important information was  revealed so let's get into it  if you enjoyed the boku no hero content  on this channel and you want us to keep  it going do me a favor  leave a like and comment and if you are  new to anime out pro or maybe you watch  our videos but you haven't subscribed  yet  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification  bell to turn on all notifications the  only way to make sure that you will  actually see my future videos and that  you won't miss them  is to take the time to subscribe hit  that notification bell  and then select the option that says all  you can also hit me up on twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  finally this video will of course  contain boku no hero manga spoilers so  please proceed with caution  you have been warned the new chapter  starts off with the still unconscious  deku wondering what happened to everyone  after the big battle in jakku but rather  than waking up  deku finds himself once again inside  that mysterious  vestige world there all of the previous  users of one for all  are waiting for him and daigo robonjo  explains that before  deku wakes up they have to talk to him  about something important  actually i shouldn't say all of the  previous one for all users are waiting  for deku two of them are just chilling  in the back  and they're facing away from deku and  towards the wall  these are the second and third users of  one for all  and i'm sure that this is supposed to be  symbolic of the fact that we still don't  know anything about them and that they  are still a mystery to us  but to be honest to me it just looks  like those two are in the process of  taking a leak  am i the only one who thinks they look  like they're taking a leak anyway  the first user of one for all explains  that in the past the  former users could only interact with  deku when he was severely mentally  shaken  but in the past four months the power of  one for all has been growing  exponentially and  this has enabled the former users to  communicate more effectively  with each other and with deku it also  seems that  all for one's infiltration into the  vestige world during the battle of jakku  has made it easier for the former users  to get in touch with deku  deku's own manifestation inside the  vestige world  is still incomplete and in particular he  still doesn't have a mouth  however it seems that his voice is  slowly manifesting itself  within this realm and he is now able to  make some noises  although his words are still muffled we  then see  that mysterious fourth user of one for  all  the one with the mark on his face that  makes him look like a character from  mashall  and the one whose information was  partially scribbled out  by all might the fourth user explains  that his name is  shinomori hagake and that he will be  doing the talking  this time around the latest quirk that  deku was able to manifest  danger sense used to belong to shinomuri  back when he was still alive the fourth  user of one for all was somewhat of a  hermit who lived in the woods  far away from society shinomori explains  that it was a turbulent time  and so for him living the life of a  hermit wasn't weird at all  under the circumstances in fact everyone  who didn't choose that lifestyle was  kind of weird as far as shinomori was  concerned  the fourth user then explains that he  died at the age of  40 and that his cause of death was  old age that is the missing piece of  information that  all might chose to hide from deku  shinomori the fourth user of one for all  died of  old age when he was only 40 years old  and the reason why he died of old age  while he was still so young  is one for all itself deku is confused  when he hears this  but shinomuri explains that he held one  for all for a long time about  18 years and in the final year of his  life  the quirk simply broke his body  one for all may be an incredibly  overpowered quirk that makes its user  very strong  but it has one extremely dangerous side  effect it appears to slowly but surely  burn away the life force of its own  holders deku is shocked to hear this and  he is  understandably concerned but then he  asks an  important question if one for all really  does have  this side effect then how was all might  able to use it way longer than shinomori  without dying of  old age at first the formal holders  didn't even know the answer to this  themselves and during this conversation  the first holder  over one's brother reveals that he  himself died in battle  not long after gaining the power of one  for all so even though he was the first  user  he wasn't exactly an expert on how one  for all worked  however once they all put their heads  together inside the vestige world  the former users eventually arrived at  the answer  the thing that made all might different  from all the other previous users  and the thing that allowed him to use  one for all for so long without  destroying his body is the simple fact  that all might  was quirkless those who are born with a  quirk  already have their metaphorical cup full  and so  adding one for all an additional quirk  to that  cup makes the cup spill over this is  what happened  to shinomori having one quirk and then  adding one for all on top of it  was too much for his body to handle so  his body simply burned  out under the pressure of so much quirk  power  but because all might was born quirkless  his body simply recognized one for all  as his true quirk and so his body wasn't  overloaded by it as it turns out despite  the fact that they are often looked down  upon in society  those individuals who are born quirkless  are the ones who have the most potential  when inheriting the power of one for all  this means that deku is safe for the  time  being as a quirkless individual himself  he should be able to handle one for all  for a long period of time  without burning out just like all might  was able to do  unless the one for all quirk keeps  changing as it seems to be doing  and those changes eventually put deco at  risk at some point in the future  we have to be open to that possibility  as well because one for all has been  evolving and growing exponentially we  just learned that  in this chapter so you never know what  the long-term consequences  of that evolution might be deku is safe  for now  but that may change in the future if the  growth of one for all spirals  out of control at any rate the former  holders of one for all  have arrived at an important conclusion  from now on they cannot risk  passing one for all on to someone who  already possesses a quirk  ever again from now on one for all must  only be passed down to individuals who  were born quirkless  but with every new generation the number  of quirkless people continues to  decrease  this means that deku could be the very  last  successor of one for all by the time  that deku is ready to pass the quirk on  to someone else  there may not be any eligible candidates  left and this might be the end  of one for all after this shocking twist  that leaves deku  reeling nanashimura steps up and lays a  very heavy burden right on deku's  shoulders  she asks deku whether he is able to kill  tomorrow shigaraki for her and that  is how this crazy info packed  chapter ends wow this  is big we just learned that one for all  has been slowly killing its own users  all the way up to the time that all  might inherited the quirk  as the first quirkless inheritor he was  able to use the quirk for a long time  and he was able to become strong enough  to stand up to  all for one and since deku was also born  quirkless  he definitely has the potential to  become as strong as  all might but we have to acknowledge the  important  implications of these huge revelations  on deku  and on the wider story not only does  this mean that deku might be the very  last  one for all user and that the quirk may  one day die  with him but this also means that if the  quirk continues to change and evolve  exponentially as it has been doing in  recent months  then eventually even deku's quirkless  body  may begin to burn out under the strain  of one for all  don't forget that this quirk is still  getting stronger and it is still growing  and expanding  so we can't just assume that deku will  be 100  safe from the negative effects of one  for all just because he didn't have a  quirk  before he inherited this quirk he is  safe for now  but that could change now a big question  that i am asking myself  after this chapter is why were the other  two one for all users  the second and third user just standing  in the back  and taking a leak why don't they feel  the need to communicate with deku  as everyone else seems to feel or is it  that they can't communicate with them  for some reason these were the two users  of one for all who came right after all  for one's brothers so who were they  and why are they hiding their faces  is it possible that while they were  alive they did some shady stuff  and because of that they are hiding  their identities  or are they hiding from deku because he  is not  ready to meet them and learn about their  quirks  like maybe these guys had really  powerful quirks that deku can't handle  yet  and so they can't communicate with him  until he is  ready or you know maybe they were just  taking a leak i also thought that it was  interesting that all might's  consciousness  or at least some fragment of it is also  present  in that vestige world even though all  might is still alive  and even though he never had a quirk  this suggests  that the consciousnesses themselves are  not directly tied to the user's  original quirk factor and so they must  arise  either from one for all itself or from  all for one  who was of course instrumental in  creating one for all in the first place  i am very curious to find out more about  the true nature of the vestiges  and how these consciousnesses are able  to survive even after the death  of the individuals they belong to and i  am sure that the answer to this question  will also be relevant to all for one  becoming an uninvited guest  in shigaraki's body finally what did you  guys think about  nana's question does she really want  deku to kill her own grandson  does she really believe that shigaraki  is completely  beyond saving and if she does do you  think that deku would actually be able  to straight up kill someone  even if that person is a villain or is  that maybe a line that deku would simply  not cross  even if that means allowing shigaraki to  continue hurting innocent people  definitely let me know what you guys  think about these important questions  down in the comments below this was a  great  chapter and i always love learning more  about the mysterious nature  of one for all we did learn a lot in  this  chapter but at the same time there is  still a lot that we don't know about one  for all  i'm sure we're gonna find out even more  about it in the future including more  about those two mysterious one for all  users who are hiding their faces  and personally i'm very excited for that  time to come if you guys enjoyed this  video and you want to see more boku no  hero content here on the channel  don't forget to leave a like it really  does help and if you are new to anime  opera  or maybe you haven't subscribed yet make  this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on  all notifications don't forget that you  really have to go through the trouble of  subscribing hitting the bell  and then clicking that option that says  all if you don't do that you're gonna  miss a ton of our videos in the future  it's just how youtube works you can also  hit me up on twitter and  instagram at animeopror a big thank you  to all of our anime uproar patrons for  making videos like this one  possible special thank you to alpha  sigma  disciple of lord twigo himself and i  can't forget all of our  the one tier patrons the ones who rise  above all  other clans including ingrata the world  a quiet respect pate heffa liam thompson  algertol dr cortman johnny boy draws  emperor otaku spidey life chanel baked  buddhist and  tungsten tarkis finally thank you also  to our pro hero tier patrons including  the one and only gilgamesh steelers on  hell crews anatoly kazatsky  joe stanton very gucci jessica califond  rathune de ora alicia octor bonnie parks  hinokami and water the red-haired raven  joanne garcia jack watches anime fat boy  games ted no ted deadly saint matthew  cruz and  anthony schreiber if you enjoy our  videos and you feel that they provide  value for you consider supporting us  on patreon even a single dollar will  give you access to our patreon exclusive  discord  and your name will appear in our videos  along with these  amazing people as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

