ss inheritor he was  able to use the quirk for a long time  and he was able to become strong enough  to stand up to  all for one and since deku was also born  quirkless  he definitely has the potential to  become as strong as  all might but we have to acknowledge the  important  implications of these huge revelations  on deku  and on the wider story not only does  this mean that deku might be the very  last  one for all user and that the quirk may  one day die  with him but this also means that if the  quirk continues to change and evolve  exponentially as it has been doing in  recent months  then eventually even deku's quirkless  body  may begin to burn out under the strain  of one for all  don't forget that this quirk is still  getting stronger and it is still growing  and expanding  so we can't just assume that deku will  be 100  safe from the negative effects of one  for all just because he didn't have a  quirk  before he inherited this quirk he is  safe for now  but that could change now a big question  that i am asking myself  after this chapter is why were the other  two one for all users  the second and third user just standing  in the back  and taking a leak why don't they feel  the need to communicate with deku  as everyone else seems to feel or is it  that they can't communicate with them  for some reason these were the two users  of one for all who came right after all  for one's brothers so who were they  and why are they hiding their faces  is it possible that while they were  alive they did some shady stuff  and because of that they are hiding  their identities  or are they hiding from deku because he  is not  ready to meet them and learn about their  quirks  like maybe these guys had really  powerful quirks that deku can't handle  yet  and so they can't communicate with him  until he is  ready or you know maybe they were just  taking a leak i also thought that it was  interesting that all might's  consciousness  or at least some fragment of it is also  present  in that vestige world even though all  might is still alive  and even though he never had a quirk  this suggests  that the consciousnesses themselves are  not directly tied to the user's  original quirk factor and so they must  arise  either from one for all itself or from  all for one  who was of course instrumental in  creating one for all in the first place  i am very curious to find out more about  the true nature of the vestiges  and how these consciousnesses are able  to survive even after the death  of the individuals they belong to and i  am sure that the answer to this question  will also be relevant to all for one  becoming an uninvited guest  in shigaraki's body finally what did you  guys think about  nana's question does she really want  deku to kill her own grandson  does she really believe that shigaraki  is completely  beyond saving and if she does do you  think that deku would actually be able  to straight up kill someone  even if that person is a villain or is  that maybe a line that deku would simply  not cross  even if that means allowing shigaraki to  continue hurting innocent people  definitely let me know what you guys  think about these important questions  down in the comments below this was a  great  chapter and i always love learning more  about the mysterious nature  of one for all we did learn a lot in  this  chapter but at the same time there is  still a lot that we don't know about one  for all  i'm sure we're gonna find out even more  about it in the future including more  about those two mysterious one for all  users who are hiding their faces  and personally i'm very excited for that  time to come if you guys enjoyed this  video and you want to see more boku no  hero content here on the channel  don't forget to leave a like it really  does help and if you are new to anime  opera  or maybe you haven't subscribed yet make  this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on  all notifications don't